WEBVTT

00:05:28.579 --> 00:05:32.413
In the current system,
there's virtually no intersection,

00:05:32.454 --> 00:05:36.788
no connection between Congress
acting in the public interest

00:05:36.829 --> 00:05:39.954
and the likelihood
of their getting reelected.

00:05:39.996 --> 00:05:45.996
If America's elected representatives
do their jobs the way we need them to,

00:05:46.038 --> 00:05:48.829
they're likely to lose those jobs.

00:05:48.871 --> 00:05:51.538
That is crazy.

00:05:51.579 --> 00:05:53.954
No wonder Congress
doesn't get anything done.

00:05:54.871 --> 00:05:58.121
OK, now let's talk
about bad rule number two:

00:05:58.163 --> 00:05:59.829
plurality voting,

00:05:59.871 --> 00:06:01.663
which I'll explain in just a moment.